  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [eslint-plugin-jest](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest) | devDependencies | minor | [`22.15.2` -> `22.21.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/eslint-plugin-jest/22.15.2/22.21.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest</summary>\n\n### [`v22.21.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.21.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.20.1...v22.21.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **valid-title:** support detecting & fixing trailing spaces in titles ([#&#8203;449](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/449)) ([8c850ff](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/8c850ffaabaf7ead5d96559130f801e6155efdc5))\n\n### [`v22.20.1`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.20.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.20.0...v22.20.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **valid-title:** check if node has arguments first ([#&#8203;436](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/436)) ([e961e21](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/e961e21e3314258660ec521d2bfaedf11823dbb1))\n\n### [`v22.20.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.20.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.19.0...v22.20.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **rules:** prefer valid-title ([#&#8203;273](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/273)) ([#&#8203;433](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/433)) ([1b2d24b](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/1b2d24bd46815a6f40f2d7b7aba99df1e108abf9))\n\n### [`v22.19.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.19.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.18.0...v22.19.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   support `allowedPrefixes` option in `lowercase-name` rule ([#&#8203;419](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/419)) ([5bd8f61](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/5bd8f6117f3dfa935da88d1e505d30cf49b585f6))\n\n### [`v22.18.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.18.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.17.0...v22.18.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **rules:** prefer-hooks-on-top ([#&#8203;425](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/425)) ([ad3fc06](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/ad3fc06b134141e1976576ec439483cbd0ccd785))\n\n### [`v22.17.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.17.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.16.0...v22.17.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **matchers:** add toStrictEqual as equality matcher ([#&#8203;412](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/412)) ([eacb78a](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/eacb78a)), closes [#&#8203;411](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/411)\n\n### [`v22.16.0`](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v22.16.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v22.15.2...v22.16.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **rules:** add `require-top-level-describe` rule ([#&#8203;407](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/407)) ([1c40d1a](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/1c40d1a)), closes [#&#8203;401](https://togithub.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/401)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
